    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rush is on since the discovery of space fish. With your trusty Space Rod in hand, reel in unique and fun space fish with their own reeling characteristics, such as the Galactic Goldfish and Cometuna. Sell your catches off in shipments and bundle them right for bonuses! Upgrade your gear with the modular rod system to handle different fish or find your perfect balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise the ranks of the Galactic Union of Interstellar Line Danglers (or GUILD) to unlock more gear, shipping perks and equipment to help you find tougher and more valuable fish, including legendary space fish with unique abilities that will test your reeling skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reel in Space Fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/a4b4880328e229c59438886b1d324fc5.poster.avif?t=1754216026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/a4b4880328e229c59438886b1d324fc5.webm?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/a4b4880328e229c59438886b1d324fc5.mp4?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your space rod is fitted with the GUILDs patented Reelscope technology to help pull in your catch. Each fish breed has its own reeling traits, and every catch is unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selling Fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/9d9c9809959017940b8230ba128905e5.poster.avif?t=1754216026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/9d9c9809959017940b8230ba128905e5.webm?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/9d9c9809959017940b8230ba128905e5.mp4?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish and Shipping go fin-in-fin. Package up your catches to send them off to the GUILD, each shipment has unique perks to meet the demand of these stellar snac...uh, specimens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buying Gear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/8ec99b8d6c7ba3a8ea40c39b93c5950c.poster.avif?t=1754216026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/8ec99b8d6c7ba3a8ea40c39b93c5950c.webm?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/8ec99b8d6c7ba3a8ea40c39b93c5950c.mp4?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trusty Space Rod is highly customisable, unlock and purchase rod parts, baits, hooks and more that can alter the characteristics and feel when reeling in Space Fish. After all what is a fisher without a range of highly customisable equipment when a stick and few kilometres of some basic laser line would do the trick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary Fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/8ff9dcd9410836efcc6c00b23dddca38.poster.avif?t=1754216026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/8ff9dcd9410836efcc6c00b23dddca38.webm?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/8ff9dcd9410836efcc6c00b23dddca38.mp4?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lookout for legendary space fish with their own unique abilities to stir up a swell. The GUILD are heavily interested in these elusive fish and will pay quite the credit if you can land them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making it your home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/501c31bb572ed7102bace94e625139b1.poster.avif?t=1754216026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/501c31bb572ed7102bace94e625139b1.webm?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/501c31bb572ed7102bace94e625139b1.mp4?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The GUILDs travel contract doesn\u2019t mention a return date, so may as well get comfortable on your new home. Spend your earnings one structures, decorations, spaceable plants, lighting, and of course, space chairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/355d5d866e275ae08f34f14e6f53544e.poster.avif?t=1754216026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/355d5d866e275ae08f34f14e6f53544e.webm?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/355d5d866e275ae08f34f14e6f53544e.mp4?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Cast your line out any direction to fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Reel in Fish with the Reelscope Rod attachment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Catch a range of unique fish with their own reeling characteristics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 A modular system for customising your space rod</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 A placement system for making the asteroid your home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rush is on since the discovery of space fish. With your trusty Space Rod in hand, reel in unique and fun space fish with their own reeling characteristics, such as the Galactic Goldfish and Cometuna. Sell your catches off in shipments and bundle them right for bonuses! Upgrade your gear with the modular rod system to handle different fish or find your perfect balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise the ranks of the Galactic Union of Interstellar Line Danglers (or GUILD) to unlock more gear, shipping perks and equipment to help you find tougher and more valuable fish, including legendary space fish with unique abilities that will test your reeling skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reel in Space Fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/a4b4880328e229c59438886b1d324fc5.poster.avif?t=1754216026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/a4b4880328e229c59438886b1d324fc5.webm?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/a4b4880328e229c59438886b1d324fc5.mp4?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your space rod is fitted with the GUILDs patented Reelscope technology to help pull in your catch. Each fish breed has its own reeling traits, and every catch is unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selling Fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/9d9c9809959017940b8230ba128905e5.poster.avif?t=1754216026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/9d9c9809959017940b8230ba128905e5.webm?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/9d9c9809959017940b8230ba128905e5.mp4?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish and Shipping go fin-in-fin. Package up your catches to send them off to the GUILD, each shipment has unique perks to meet the demand of these stellar snac...uh, specimens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buying Gear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/8ec99b8d6c7ba3a8ea40c39b93c5950c.poster.avif?t=1754216026\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/8ec99b8d6c7ba3a8ea40c39b93c5950c.webm?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/8ec99b8d6c7ba3a8ea40c39b93c5950c.mp4?t=1754216026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trusty Space Rod is highly customisable, unlock and purchase rod parts, baits, hooks and more that can alter the characteristics and feel when reeling in Space Fish. After all what is a fisher without a range of highly customisable equipment when a stick and few kilometres of some basic laser line would do the trick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary Fish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744670/extras/8ff9dcd9410836efcc6c00b23dddca38.poster.avif